                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "231592428",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561199815793369",
                            "num_reviews": 381,
                            "playtime_forever": 27,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 27,
                            "last_played": 1785332448
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An incredibly immersive, action-packed, and thrilling VR arena battler that makes you feel like a true master of the elements! Stepping into a mythical world of martial arts where you can physically punch the air to launch blazing fireballs or raise massive earthen shields with your actual hands is every bit as satisfying as it sounds.The stylized fantasy arenas and the clever combination of arcade fighting strategies with fast-paced, motion-controlled shooter mechanics capture that pure, high-energy adrenaline rush flawlessly. Managing your positioning in 3D space, carefully timing your elemental parries, and executing complex gesture-based combos to completely overpower your opponent creates a deeply rewarding and sweat-inducing gameplay loop.It is the absolute perfect, physically engaging indie arcade fighter for putting your real-world reflexes to the test, living out your ultimate spellcasting power fantasies, and enjoying a uniquely tactile VR experience. A highly creative, action-fueled gem that offers immense fun for anyone looking to weaponize nature itself. Definitely recommended!",
